{"Title":"An Act relative to nonprofit board member compensation","BillNumber":"H4358","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J19","Name":"Joint Committee on the Judiciary","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T15:04:23.95"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T14:10:28.7333333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4358/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 85W of chapter 231 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking, in lines 2-3, the words “ compensation, other than reimbursement for actual expenses” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- compensation (other than reimbursement or allowance for expenses actually incurred” or any other thing of value in lieu of compensation not in excess of $500 per year. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 85W of said chapter 231 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by striking, in line 7, the word “his” and inserting in place thereof the following word:- their.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}